{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/253c91a220441971c09156fe5a5bbd34.avif?t=1768556277\" width=1560 height=894 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carhem is an online party game, featuring physics based combat with cars. You and up to 7 friends battle it out for victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/f6b134a545f6a65661b9cc4be1202a32.avif?t=1768556277\" width=1560 height=181 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to win is to outlast your opponents. Make sure you get to the circle on time to stay alive! \u2026 And be careful not to fall off the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/cfb509f724f6f123b1148242206eea45.avif?t=1768556277\" width=1560 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carhem features nearly a dozen unique cars, and each of them has a unique play style and ability. Want bigger critical hits to focus on killing your opponents? You got it. Want extra speed for survivability? That\u2019s an option too.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/359316d3ef5f6b615aa5aad92ccd22ac.avif?t=1768556277\" width=1560 height=181 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carhem features more than a dozen unique items of varying rarities that upgrade your car in amazing ways. From extra jumps, to extra damage for your collisions, collect as many as possible to give you a big advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/cb19e68b1fc812f1c2588f5e59b41267.avif?t=1768556277\" width=1560 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based combat naturally allows for funny moments to occur. These moments are made even funnier by Carhem's proximity chat, listen as your friends screams fade into the distance as you knock them off the map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you ready for some <span class=\"bb_strike\">mayhem</span>\u00a0<strong><i>Carhem</i></strong>?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349910?t=1768556277","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349910?t=1768556277","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/32ceccd848d7cb944bb25d0bf67c98b62861919d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768556277","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/32ceccd848d7cb944bb25d0bf67c98b62861919d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768556277","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/253c91a220441971c09156fe5a5bbd34.avif?t=1768556277\" width=1560 height=894 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carhem is an online party game, featuring physics based combat with cars. You and up to 7 friends battle it out for victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/f6b134a545f6a65661b9cc4be1202a32.avif?t=1768556277\" width=1560 height=181 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to win is to outlast your opponents. Make sure you get to the circle on time to stay alive! \u2026 And be careful not to fall off the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/cfb509f724f6f123b1148242206eea45.avif?t=1768556277\" width=1560 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carhem features nearly a dozen unique cars, and each of them has a unique play style and ability. Want bigger critical hits to focus on killing your opponents? You got it. Want extra speed for survivability? That\u2019s an option too.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/359316d3ef5f6b615aa5aad92ccd22ac.avif?t=1768556277\" width=1560 height=181 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carhem features more than a dozen unique items of varying rarities that upgrade your car in amazing ways. From extra jumps, to extra damage for your collisions, collect as many as possible to give you a big advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/cb19e68b1fc812f1c2588f5e59b41267.avif?t=1768556277\" width=1560 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based combat naturally allows for funny moments to occur. These moments are made even funnier by Carhem's proximity chat, listen as your friends screams fade into the distance as you knock them off the map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you ready for some <span class=\"bb_strike\">mayhem</span>\u00a0<strong><i>Carhem</i></strong>?</p>","developers":["Bouka Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description